{"content": "Here are the primary causes of the 2008 financial crisis summarized in five bullet points:\n\n*   **Subprime Mortgage Lending**: Banks issued large numbers of mortgages to borrowers with poor credit histories (subprime borrowers) who were unlikely to be able to repay them, often with adjustable-rate terms that would increase significantly after an initial low-rate period.\n*   **Housing Bubble and Speculation**: Excessive demand for housing, fueled by easy credit and speculative investment, drove home prices to unsustainable levels, creating a bubble that eventually burst when prices began to fall.\n*   **Securitization and Complex Financial Instruments**: Banks bundled these risky mortgages into complex securities called Mortgage-Backed Securities (MBS) and Collateralized Debt Obligations (CDOs), which", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.1712827279911764, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.1712827279911764}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -1.917532880579067}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -5.062205274377895}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -6.775973279748989}, {"token": "While", "logprob": -7.032160718713833}, {"token": "\u2022", "logprob": -7.393786390100551}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -7.98551460054977}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.514450986658169}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -8.602528531824184}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -9.272911985193325}, {"token": "Although", "logprob": -10.07057090548141}, {"token": "Please", "logprob": -10.447562177454067}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -10.517525632654262}, {"token": "Note", "logprob": -10.53481002596481}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -10.699507673059536}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -10.82765384462936}, {"token": "***", "logprob": -10.923710782800747}, {"token": "here", "logprob": -10.963986356531215}, {"token": "There", "logprob": -11.135449369226528}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.156563718591762}]}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.029165806748945755, "top_logprobs": [{