{"content": "Here is a recipe for a **Simple & Hearty Vegetarian Chili**. This version is packed with flavor, uses common pantry staples, and comes together in about 30\u201340 minutes. It\u2019s naturally gluten-free and can easily be made vegan.\n\n### \ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Simple Vegetarian Chili\n\n**Prep Time:** 15 minutes  \n**Cook Time:** 25\u201330 minutes  \n**Serves:** 4\u20136\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\uded2 Ingredients\n\n*   **1 tbsp** olive oil or vegetable oil\n*   **1 medium** onion, diced\n*   **3 cloves** garlic, minced\n*   **1 medium** bell pepper (any color), diced\n*   **1 tsp** ground cumin\n*  ", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.0020867271323119496, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.0020867271323119496}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -6.243284313191882}, {"token": "Absolutely", "logprob": -9.77746209334325}, {"token": "Sure", "logprob": -10.955436794270984}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -11.076932994832507}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.472377864827624}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -11.723522274007312}, {"token": "Simple", "logprob": -12.032810298909656}, {"token": "Making", "logprob": -12.873846141805164}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -12.992508022298328}, {"token": " Here", "logprob": -13.174831478108874}, {"token": "Certainly", "logprob": -13.233364192952624}, {"token": "Of", "logprob": -13.358553020467273}, {"token": "Classic", "logprob": -13.408655254353992}, {"token": "Hom", "logprob": -13.881141750325671}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -13.917251674642078}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -14.051939098348132}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -14.061903087605945}, {"token": "here", "logprob": -14.13929948042821}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -14.3192711753745}]}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.004927191051823598, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " is", "logprob": -0.004927191051823598}, {"token": "\u2019s", "logprob": -5.324583563122136}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -10.265026602062566}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -11