{"content": "Here is the regular expression for a US ZIP code, followed by a detailed explanation.\n\n### The Regular Expression\n\n```regex\n^\\d{5}(-\\d{4})?$\n```\n\n### Explanation\n\nHere is a breakdown of how the pattern works, component by component:\n\n1.  **`^` (Start Anchor)**\n    *   Ensures the match starts at the very beginning of the string. This prevents the regex from matching a ZIP code that is part of a larger number (e.g., preventing `12345` from matching inside `112345`).\n\n2.  **`\\d{5}` (The 5-Digit Base)**\n    *   `\\d`: Matches any single digit (0\u20139).", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.9796524717959443, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.9796524717959443}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -1.1667061522158662}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -2.191822119012741}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -2.3402748778018037}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -3.1912079527529755}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -3.201896734491257}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -5.00181204821196}, {"token": "Regular", "logprob": -5.349762029901413}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -5.592250890985397}, {"token": "US", "logprob": -6.27177054430571}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -6.345985479608444}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -6.8411617949160615}, {"token": "Below", "logprob": -7.936677999750046}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -7.9789276793154755}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -8.503533430353073}, {"token": "Regex", "logprob": -8.524330206170944}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -8.59220511461821}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -8.759933538690476}, {"token": "Use", "logprob": -8.829439230218796}, {"token": "For", "logprob": -9.031748838678268}]}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.004706966178549266, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " is", "logprob": -0.004706966178549266}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -5.655791866080893}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -7.051622020499838}, {"token": "\u2019s", "logprob": -8.571204768912924}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -10.167687999503745}, {"tok