{"content": "**Introducing the Apex Pure: Your Daily Companion for Hydration**\n\nStay refreshed, anywhere, anytime. The **Apex Pure** stainless steel water bottle is engineered for those who value durability, style, and sustainability. Whether you\u2019re conquering a mountain trail, powering through a busy workday, or cooling down after a gym session, this bottle is designed to keep your water at the perfect temperature.\n\n### Key Features:\n\n*   **Dual-Wall Vacuum Insulation:** Keeps drinks **cold for up to 24 hours** and **hot for up to 12 hours**, so your morning coffee stays scalding and your afternoon water stays crisp.\n*   **Premium 18/8 Stainless Steel:** Made from food-grade, BPA-free stainless steel that", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.23644879649217643, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.23644879649217643}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -2.0680604297929577}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -2.8810582477861217}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -4.208986790876942}, {"token": "Meet", "logprob": -5.296247990828114}, {"token": "Int", "logprob": -5.822992833357411}, {"token": "Re", "logprob": -6.97518018076952}, {"token": "Keep", "logprob": -7.179743321638661}, {"token": "S", "logprob": -7.343884022932606}, {"token": "Title", "logprob": -7.958431752424794}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -8.14477017710741}, {"token": "E", "logprob": -8.251387150984364}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -8.575077565413075}, {"token": "Un", "logprob": -8.659874470930653}, {"token": "Stay", "logprob": -9.073721440535145}, {"token": "Experience", "logprob": -9.166021855574208}, {"token": "Product", "logprob": -9.19943669627245}, {"token": "Hy", "logprob": -9.241940053206044}, {"token": "Rev", "logprob": -9.437464268904286}, {"token": "Ever", "logprob": -9.93951466868456}]}, {"token": "Int", "logprob": -1.3999950497941107, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Int", "logprob": -1.3999950497941107}, {"token": "Re", "logprob": -1.8732215970353217}, {"token": "Me