{"content": "## Docker Containers\n\nA **Docker container** is a lightweight, standalone, executable package of software that includes everything needed to run an application: code, runtime, system tools, libraries, and settings. Containers run on a single operating system kernel and share the host OS\u2019s kernel, but are isolated from each other in terms of filesystem, processes, and network.\n\n### Key Characteristics\n- **Lightweight**: No need to boot a full guest OS.\n- **Fast startup**: Containers can start in seconds (vs. minutes for VMs).\n- **Consistent environments**: \"Works on my machine\" problem is solved because the container bundles all dependencies.\n- **Isolation**: Each container has its own filesystem, network, and process namespace.\n\n---\n\n## Virtual Machines (", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -0.30007430874858443, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -0.30007430874858443}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -2.2139727767661626}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -2.3708541091636235}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -3.8129946883872563}, {"token": "D", "logprob": -4.134379118318897}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.793225019808155}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -5.4783065017417485}, {"token": "Think", "logprob": -6.3035323318198735}, {"token": "At", "logprob": -6.958100050325733}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -6.95991584622417}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -7.285910337801319}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -8.076588362093311}, {"token": "Understanding", "logprob": -8.602295606966358}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -8.885143965120655}, {"token": "Imagine", "logprob": -9.490355223055225}, {"token": "An", "logprob": -9.528244703646045}, {"token": "Thinking", "logprob": -9.55365821682964}, {"token": "When", "logprob": -9.71722671353374}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -9.753220289583545}, {"token": "Ex", "logprob": -9.84772559964214}]}, {"token": " Docker", "logprob": -0.08491624604027592, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " Docker", "logprob": -0