{"content": "Detective: \"You claim you were home alone all night, but your neighbor saw a car leave your driveway at midnight.\"\nSuspect: \"It was just my brother, he was visiting for the weekend.\"\nDetective: \"Your brother\u2019s alibi places him in Chicago, three hundred miles away.\"\nSuspect: \"He... he must have taken a late flight back, I didn't check the details.\"\nDetective: \"A flight that didn't exist until you mentioned it just now.\"\nSuspect: \"So, what are you saying, that I lied about the car?\"", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Detect", "logprob": -0.4644666708221301, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Detect", "logprob": -0.4644666708221301}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -1.3300748861541614}, {"token": "\"", "logprob": -2.6025873220672473}, {"token": "\"You", "logprob": -4.312895397018419}, {"token": "\"The", "logprob": -5.4342504537811145}, {"token": "Det", "logprob": -6.427742580245958}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -6.474602321456896}, {"token": "\"I", "logprob": -6.508867839645372}, {"token": "\"So", "logprob": -7.085592845748888}, {"token": "\u201c", "logprob": -7.381146053146349}, {"token": "\"It", "logprob": -7.4845129049529895}, {"token": "\"We", "logprob": -7.671215633224474}, {"token": "\"Do", "logprob": -7.70683727629088}, {"token": " Detective", "logprob": -7.871655086349474}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -7.918470958541857}, {"token": "\"S", "logprob": -7.933554271530138}, {"token": "Sus", "logprob": -8.151264766525255}, {"token": "\"What", "logprob": -8.252924541305529}, {"token": "\"Well", "logprob": -8.254347423385607}, {"token": "\"D", "logprob": -8.274839977096544}]}, {"token": "ive", "logprob": -1.872908771360926e-05, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "ive", "logprob": -1.872908771360926e-05}, {"token": "ives", "logprob": -11.904943121787909}, {"token": "ore", "logprob": -12.068515433189276}, {"token": "IVE", "logprob": -12.682153357383612}, {"token": "ve", "logprob": -14.226960791465643}, {"token": "or", "logprob": -14.305085791465